    "The App Store version of PureMac isn’t allowed to run Docker’s tools. See Docker Desktop → Settings → Resources, or `docker system df`." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يُسمح لإصدار App Store من PureMac بتشغيل أدوات Docker. راجِع Docker Desktop ← الإعدادات ← الموارد، أو `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store-versionen af PureMac må ikke køre Dockers værktøjer. Se Docker Desktop → Indstillinger → Ressourcer, eller `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die App Store-Version von PureMac darf Dockers Werkzeuge nicht ausführen. Siehe Docker Desktop → Einstellungen → Ressourcen oder `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PureMacin App Store -versio ei saa suorittaa Dockerin työkaluja. Katso Docker Desktop → Asetukset → Resurssit tai `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La version App Store de PureMac n’est pas autorisée à exécuter les outils de Docker. Voir Docker Desktop → Réglages → Ressources, ou `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La versione App Store di PureMac non può eseguire gli strumenti di Docker. Vedi Docker Desktop → Impostazioni → Risorse, oppure `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store 版の PureMac は Docker のツールを実行できません。Docker Desktop →「設定」→「リソース」、または `docker system df` をご覧ください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store 버전의 PureMac은 Docker 도구를 실행할 수 없습니다. Docker Desktop → 설정 → 리소스 또는 `docker system df`를 확인하십시오."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store-versjonen av PureMac har ikke lov til å kjøre Dockers verktøy. Se Docker Desktop → Innstillinger → Ressurser, eller `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De App Store-versie van PureMac mag de tools van Docker niet uitvoeren. Zie Docker Desktop → Instellingen → Bronnen, of `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wersja PureMac z App Store nie może uruchamiać narzędzi Dockera. Zobacz Docker Desktop → Ustawienia → Zasoby lub `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A versão da App Store do PureMac não pode executar as ferramentas do Docker. Veja Docker Desktop → Ajustes → Recursos, ou `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Версии PureMac из App Store не разрешено запускать инструменты Docker. См. Docker Desktop → Настройки → Ресурсы или `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store-versionen av PureMac får inte köra Dockers verktyg. Se Docker Desktop → Inställningar → Resurser eller `docker system df`."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PureMac’in App Store sürümünün Docker’ın araçlarını çalıştırmasına izin verilmez. Docker Desktop → Ayarlar → Kaynaklar’a bakın ya da `docker system df` komutunu kullanın."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store 版本的 PureMac 不允许运行 Docker 的工具。请参阅 Docker Desktop →“设置”→“资源”，或使用 `docker system df`。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store 版本的 PureMac 不允許執行 Docker 的工具。請參閱 Docker Desktop →「設定」→「資源」，或使用 `docker system df`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The App Store version of PureMac isn’t allowed to run them. Use Xcode → Settings → Platforms, or `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يُسمح لإصدار App Store من PureMac بتشغيلها. استخدم Xcode ← الإعدادات ← المنصات، أو `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store-versionen af PureMac må ikke køre dem. Brug Xcode → Indstillinger → Platforme, eller `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die App Store-Version von PureMac darf sie nicht ausführen. Nutze Xcode → Einstellungen → Plattformen oder `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PureMacin App Store -versio ei saa suorittaa niitä. Käytä kohtaa Xcode → Asetukset → Alustat tai komentoa `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La version App Store de PureMac n’est pas autorisée à les exécuter. Utilisez Xcode → Réglages → Plateformes, ou `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La versione App Store di PureMac non può eseguirli. Usa Xcode → Impostazioni → Piattaforme, oppure `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store 版の PureMac はそれらを実行できません。Xcode →「設定」→「プラットフォーム」、または `xcrun simctl delete unavailable` を使ってください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store 버전의 PureMac은 이를 실행할 수 없습니다. Xcode → 설정 → 플랫폼 또는 `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`을 사용하십시오."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store-versjonen av PureMac har ikke lov til å kjøre dem. Bruk Xcode → Innstillinger → Plattformer, eller `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De App Store-versie van PureMac mag ze niet uitvoeren. Gebruik Xcode → Instellingen → Platforms, of `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wersja PureMac z App Store nie może ich uruchamiać. Użyj Xcode → Ustawienia → Platformy lub `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A versão da App Store do PureMac não pode executá-las. Use Xcode → Ajustes → Plataformas, ou `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Версии PureMac из App Store не разрешено их запускать. Используйте Xcode → Настройки → Платформы или `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store-versionen av PureMac får inte köra dem. Använd Xcode → Inställningar → Plattformar eller `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PureMac’in App Store sürümünün bunları çalıştırmasına izin verilmez. Xcode → Ayarlar → Platformlar’ı ya da `xcrun simctl delete unavailable` komutunu kullanın."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store 版本的 PureMac 不允许运行它们。请使用 Xcode →“设置”→“平台”，或 `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store 版本的 PureMac 不允許執行它們。請使用 Xcode →「設定」→「平台」，或 `xcrun simctl delete unavailable`。"
          }
